REFERENCE SITES (study these for realistic prop values and block usage): SNEAKER STORE EXAMPLE (STRIDE brand — use to understand realistic Hero/Features/CardGrid/Testimonials/CTABanner/StatsBanner usage): {"id":"stride-home","slug":"home","title":"STRIDE — Home","seo":{"title":"STRIDE Sneakers — Run the Future","description":"Premium athletic footwear engineered for champions."},"blocks":[{"id":"block-hero-1","type":"Hero","props":{"title":"Run the Future","subtitle":"STRIDE — Athletic footwear engineered for champions. Lightweight. Durable. Unstoppable.","ctaText":"Shop Now","ctaUrl":"/products"},"styles":{"":{"background-color":"#111827","color":"#ffffff"}}},{"id":"block-stats-1","type":"StatsBanner","props":{"bgColor":"#f97316","textColor":"#ffffff","columns":4,"stats":[{"value":"2M+","label":"Pairs Sold","icon":"👟"},{"value":"4.9★","label":"Avg Rating","icon":"⭐"},{"value":"120+","label":"Countries","icon":"🌍"},{"value":"10yr","label":"Warranty","icon":"🛡️"}]}},{"id":"block-features-1","type":"Features","props":{"heading":"Built Different","subheading":"Every detail engineered for peak performance.","columns":3,"features":[{"icon":"⚡","title":"Ultralight Foam","description":"Our proprietary ReactX foam cuts weight by 40% without sacrificing cushion."},{"icon":"🌬️","title":"AirMesh Upper","description":"360° breathable mesh keeps your feet cool during the longest runs."},{"icon":"🔥","title":"Grip-Lock Outsole","description":"Multi-directional grip pattern for traction on any surface, wet or dry."}]},"styles":{"":{"padding-top":"64px","padding-bottom":"64px"}}},{"id":"block-cardgrid-1","type":"CardGrid","props":{"heading":"New Arrivals","columns":3,"cards":[{"imageUrl":"https://placehold.co/400x400/f97316/ffffff?text=APEX+PRO","title":"APEX PRO","text":"Track-to-street trainer. Responsive, bold.","ctaLabel":"Shop $149","ctaUrl":"/products/apex-pro"},{"imageUrl":"https://placehold.co/400x400/111827/f97316?text=CLOUD+X","title":"CLOUD X","text":"All-day comfort runner. Cloud cushion tech.","ctaLabel":"Shop $129","ctaUrl":"/products/cloud-x"},{"imageUrl":"https://placehold.co/400x400/6b21a8/ffffff?text=TEMPO+V2","title":"TEMPO V2","text":"Speed racer's choice. 7oz ultralight.","ctaLabel":"Shop $179","ctaUrl":"/products/tempo-v2"}]}},{"id":"block-testimonials-1","type":"Testimonials","props":{"heading":"What Runners Say","layout":"grid","testimonials":[{"text":"STRIDE's APEX PRO broke my personal record at Boston. The grip on wet roads is unreal.","author":"Marcus T.","role":"Marathon runner","avatarUrl":"https://placehold.co/64x64/f97316/ffffff?text=MT","rating":5},{"text":"I've worn these for 800+ miles and they still feel fresh. Best investment I've made.","author":"Sasha K.","role":"Ultra trail runner","avatarUrl":"https://placehold.co/64x64/111827/ffffff?text=SK","rating":5},{"text":"Switched from a big brand — never going back. STRIDE actually listens to athletes.","author":"Devon R.","role":"CrossFit coach","avatarUrl":"https://placehold.co/64x64/6b21a8/ffffff?text=DR","rating":5}]}},{"id":"block-cta-1","type":"CTABanner","props":{"heading":"Your Next PR Starts Here","subtext":"Free shipping on orders over $100. 30-day returns, no questions asked.","buttonLabel":"Shop All Sneakers","buttonUrl":"/products","bgColor":"#f97316","textColor":"#ffffff"}}]} COURSES PAGE EXAMPLE (Alex Rivera personal brand — use to understand TextBlock/CardGrid/Testimonials/NewsletterSignup/StatsBanner usage): {"id":"alex-courses","slug":"courses","title":"Alex Rivera — Courses","seo":{"title":"Learn with Alex Rivera — Online Courses","description":"Practical courses in design, productivity, and creative thinking by Alex Rivera."},"blocks":[{"id":"block-hero-1","type":"Hero","props":{"title":"Learn Skills That Actually Matter","subtitle":"Hi, I'm Alex Rivera. I teach design thinking, creative productivity, and systems that help you build work you're proud of.","ctaText":"Browse Courses","ctaUrl":"#courses"},"styles":{"":{"background-color":"#0f172a","color":"#f8fafc"}}},{"id":"block-stats-1","type":"StatsBanner","props":{"bgColor":"#38bdf8","textColor":"#0f172a","columns":3,"stats":[{"value":"12,000+","label":"Students","icon":"🎓"},{"value":"4.8★","label":"Avg Rating","icon":"⭐"},{"value":"6","label":"Courses","icon":"📚"}]}},{"id":"block-text-about","type":"TextBlock","props":{"text":"I spent 10 years as a senior designer at companies like Airbnb and Notion before going independent. Now I teach everything I wish I'd known earlier — from design systems to creative blocks to building a career you love. Every course is hands-on, practical, and built around real projects."},"styles":{"":{"text-align":"center","padding-top":"48px","padding-bottom":"48px"}}},{"id":"block-cardgrid-courses","type":"CardGrid","props":{"heading":"My Courses","columns":3,"cards":[{"imageUrl":"https://placehold.co/400x240/0f172a/38bdf8?text=Design+Systems+101","title":"Design Systems 101","text":"Build scalable component libraries in Figma from scratch. 8 weeks, 40 lessons.","ctaLabel":"Enroll — $199","ctaUrl":"/courses/design-systems"},{"imageUrl":"https://placehold.co/400x240/38bdf8/0f172a?text=Creative+Unblocked","title":"Creative Unblocked","text":"Break through creative blocks and ship work you're proud of. Self-paced.","ctaLabel":"Enroll — $99","ctaUrl":"/courses/creative-unblocked"},{"imageUrl":"https://placehold.co/400x240/7c3aed/ffffff?text=Career+Launchpad","title":"Career Launchpad","text":"Land your first design job or level up to senior. Resume, portfolio, interviews.","ctaLabel":"Enroll — $149","ctaUrl":"/courses/career-launchpad"}]}},{"id":"block-testimonials-1","type":"Testimonials","props":{"heading":"Student Stories","layout":"grid","testimonials":[{"text":"Alex's Design Systems course got me a job at a top agency within 3 weeks of finishing. The real-world projects made all the difference.","author":"Jamie L.","role":"Junior Designer → Agency hire","avatarUrl":"https://placehold.co/64x64/38bdf8/0f172a?text=JL","rating":5},{"text":"Creative Unblocked changed how I approach every project. I finally shipped the side project I'd been stuck on for two years.","author":"Priya M.","role":"Freelance illustrator","avatarUrl":"https://placehold.co/64x64/7c3aed/ffffff?text=PM","rating":5},{"text":"Clear, no-fluff, genuinely useful. Alex teaches like a mentor, not a lecturer. Worth every penny.","author":"Chris O.","role":"Product designer, fintech","avatarUrl":"https://placehold.co/64x64/0f172a/38bdf8?text=CO","rating":5}]}},{"id":"block-newsletter-1","type":"NewsletterSignup","props":{"title":"Get the Free Design Thinking Starter Kit","description":"Join 12,000+ designers. One email per week — frameworks, resources, and case studies from my practice.","placeholder":"your@email.com","buttonLabel":"Send me the kit","successMessage":"Check your inbox! Your starter kit is on its way."}},{"id":"block-cta-1","type":"CTABanner","props":{"heading":"Ready to Level Up?","subtext":"All courses come with lifetime access, community support, and a 30-day money-back guarantee.","buttonLabel":"Browse All Courses","buttonUrl":"#courses","bgColor":"#0f172a","textColor":"#38bdf8"}}]}
CURRENT PAGE JSON: {{CURRENT_PAGE}}
TARGET INTERFACE: interface Page { id: string slug: string title?: string seo?: { title: string; description?: string } blocks: Array<{ id: string type: string props: Record styles?: Record<string, Record> customCss?: string }> }
EDITING RULES: 1. Return the COMPLETE updated Page JSON — not a diff, not a partial update. 2. Preserve all existing block `id` values unless the user explicitly asks to remove a block. 3. Only modify the props and styles the user mentioned — leave everything else unchanged. 4. If the user asks to ADD a block, append it at the end of `blocks[]` (or where they specify). 5. If the user asks to REMOVE a block, omit it from the returned `blocks[]` array. 6. If the user asks to REORDER blocks, reflect the new order in `blocks[]`. 7. When adding NEW blocks, use short unique IDs like "hero-2", "text-3", "cta-1". 8. NEVER invent block types not listed in the schema registry above. 9. If unsure what the user wants, return the page unchanged and add a comment in `seo.description` starting with "AI note: ". 10. Color values must be valid CSS colors (hex, rgb, hsl, named). 11. Array props (like `items`, `plans`, `links`) must be valid JSON arrays, not strings.
OUTPUT: Return ONLY the raw JSON object. No markdown, no code fences, no explanation.
